kaeru (0.2.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the system tray menu, which stayed frozen at its initial state:
    activation, release, expiry, failure/denial and Pause All now refresh
    the open menu and the turn-off action together with the icon.
  * Show the exact live tray status Kaeru: OFF / ON / ACTIVATING… / ERROR;
    enable "Turn off Kaeru" only while inhibition is confirmed active.
  * Shorten tray wording to "Kaeru" and "Turn off Kaeru"; the main window
    keeps the descriptive "Keep Awake" name.
  * Add regression tests for all effective wake states and action gating.

 -- Kaeru Maintainers <kaeru@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 06:50:00 -0500

kaeru (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial user-facing release focused on dependable Keep Awake.
  * Single-request Keep Awake model: choosing 15 minutes, 30 minutes,
    1 hour, 2 hours or Indefinitely replaces the current request instead
    of stacking another timer.
  * Fix the xdg-desktop-portal activation race by subscribing to the
    predicted request handle before Inhibit; activation, release and quit
    now behave reliably.
  * Timed Keep Awake expiry releases the inhibitor, clears the UI state
    and can send a desktop notification.
  * Focus Timer, Work Log and Reports are deferred from the user interface
    and CLI. Their source, tests and any existing stored data are kept.
  * Render the official frog artwork from the supplied PNG variants to
    avoid Qt 6.2 SVG mis-rendering; add icon regression tests.
  * Fix autostart: "kaeru --background --awake-on-login" starts hidden and
    enables Keep Awake at login.
  * Simplified GUI with Keep Awake, Settings and Diagnostics pages, plus
    a File > Quit path and clearer release packaging.

 -- Kaeru Maintainers <kaeru@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500
